"life-ad-layout life-ad-layout-toc"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-rail","data-dock-active":"false","style":{"top":"94px"}},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-dock","hidden":true},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored life-ad-space-compact","data-ad-placement":"ad_dock","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Advertisement · Community recommendation"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-ad-dismiss","aria-label":"Close ad"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-x","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 6 6 18"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 6 12 12"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Official Shengcai Youshu logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Advertisement · Community recommendation"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Could what you know become a useful product?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["From ebooks to small tools, explore how members spot needs and turn knowledge into something people can use."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/en/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_dock"},"children":["Explore the community and examples",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 7h10v10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 17 17 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/17"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Having elderly family members at home"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"data-ad-dock-host":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"While the elderly are still lucid, designate a future guardian in writing"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Make a will — remember that later ones override earlier ones, and notarized wills no longer take priority"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Keep the elderly person’s money in a separate account and set a rule requiring two people to approve any large withdrawals"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"A ready-made phrase for seniors to deflect unwanted offers"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Avoid any “investment-based senior care” schemes that require upfront payments: card enrollment, prepaid care fees, buying senior housing units, travel-based care programs, and sales of senior products all fall under the same category of illegal fundraising"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Apart from the housing reverse mortgage insurance offered by insurers, you should avoid all other “housing-for-pension” schemes — never mortgage your home to buy financial products"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"For elderly individuals at home who are bedridden or severely disabled, apply to the local yibao (basic medical insurance) office for long-term care insurance; it is not limited to seniors only"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/17-08","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"For families with someone bedridden at home, pressure ulcers are a top concern: use an electric alternating-pressure air mattress, turn the patient regularly, and check bony areas daily"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"If an older person’s cataracts already affect walking safely, have an eye doctor assess surgery; when both eyes are affected, do not delay the second eye too long"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"When an older person walks a dog, hold the leash in the palm and never wrap it around the hand, keep the leash short, and train the dog first not to lunge forward on the leash"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/17"},"children":["Chapter 17"," ·"," ","Having elderly family members at home"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["08"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidence"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["For families with someone bedridden at home, pressure ulcers are a top concern: use an electric alternating-pressure air mattress, turn the patient regularly, and check bony areas daily"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Pressure ulcers are far more than just superficial skin injuries. Among 19,520 patients undergoing hip‑fracture surgery, those already having pressure ulcers at admission had a roughly 20% higher chance of dying within 30 days. Three evidence‑based actions help: using an electric air mattress cuts new ulcer formation by about 60% compared with ordinary hospital mattresses; consistently turning the patient reduces risk by roughly 70% versus standard care; and keeping the person from lying prone for long periods also helps. Check the sacrum, heels, hips, and shoulders each day; if any area shows persistent redness that doesn’t fade when pressed, contact a nurse or doctor right away. A total of 1,226 patients showed similar trends, and 116 patients demonstrated a clear increase in ulcer risk under prone positioning."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Electric alternating-pressure air mattresses for home use…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Data come from 19,520 hip‑fracture patients in the U.S. NSQIP registry (2016‑2019). Those with pre‑existing pr…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: For families with someone bedridden at home, pressure ulcers are a top concern: use an electric alternating-pressure air mattress, turn the patient regularly, and check bony areas daily"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Electric alternating-pressure air mattresses for home use start at a few hundred yuan. Turning a patient takes just a few minutes. The real challenge is doing it every two to three hours, even at night — no single caregiver can manage that alone."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Data come from 19,520 hip‑fracture patients in the U.S. NSQIP registry (2016‑2019). Those with pre‑existing pressure ulcers showed a higher 30‑day mortality rate; after adjusting for other factors, this link remained significant (OR 1.2, a 21% increase in risk, P = 0.004). They also faced higher rates of deep‑vein thrombosis (OR 1.59), pneumonia (OR 1.39), unplanned readmissions (OR 1.43), and an average hospital stay 0.4 days longer. In a follow‑up of 324 elderly inpatients (mean age 86) over 18 months, pressure ulcers independently predicted long‑term death (HR 1.500, 95% CI 1.059‑2.126, P = 0.020). A network meta‑analysis of 65 randomized trials compared electric alternating‑pressure air mattresses with standard hospital mattresses; the former lowered ulcer incidence (RR 0.42, 95% CI 0.29‑0.63, moderate certainty). Similar benefits were seen with hybrid systems (RR 0.22, 95% CI 0.07‑0.66). A 2026 Cochrane review of 11 trials involving 4,462 patients found little difference between turning schedules of 2 hours versus 4 hours (RR 1.05, 95% CI 0.79‑1.39, very low certainty). However, using wearable sensors to enforce 2‑hour turning intervals in an ICU setting cut ulcer rates compared with usual care (RR 0.28, 95% CI 0.10‑0.75, moderate certainty). Finally, patients kept in a prone position developed ulcers far more often than those lying supine (RR 4.55, 95% CI 2.31‑8.98)."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Porter SB, Pla R, Chow JH, et al. (2022). Preoperative Pressure Ulcers, Mortality, and Complications in Older Hip Fracture Surgery Patients. JAAOS Global Research & Reviews, 6(11). ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.5435/JAAOSGlobal-D-22-00117","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.5435/JAAOSGlobal-D-22-00117"]},"；Ottaviani S, Rondanina E, Longo E, 等 (2026). Impact of pressure ulcers and frailty on long-term mortality: a prospective cohort study of hospitalized older adults. European Geriatric Medicine, 17(2), 665-672. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s41999-025-01331-8","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s41999-025-01331-8"]},"；Shi C, Dumville JC, Cullum N (2018). Support surfaces for pressure ulcer prevention: A network meta-analysis. PLoS ONE, 13(2), e0192707. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0192707","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0192707"]},"；Latimer SL, Chaboyer WP, Probst S, 等 (2026). Repositioning for pressure injury prevention in adults. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, 6, CD009958. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD009958.pub4","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD009958.pub4"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.5435/JAAOSGlobal-D-22-00117","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["This grade reflects three main points. First, the mortality studies showed only that patients with ulcers fared worse; they did not prove that preventing ulcers directly lowers death rates. Second, the evidence on optimal turning intervals from randomized trials is quite weak. Third, the data on air mattresses are relatively stronger, yet they compared hospital‑grade mattresses to ordinary home mattresses, so extrapolation to home use is somewhat uncertain. Daily inspection of bony areas is standard nursing practice and lacks dedicated research support. The mortality benefit is evaluated separately from cost calculations for other items in this section. Home‑based care services covered by long‑term care insurance are described in item 7. Sudden leg swelling should be treated as a possible deep‑vein thrombosis, as covered in section 13, item 11. Situations involving prolonged bed rest after falls or severe injury are discussed in section 1, item 34."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24